OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 133 homes on farmland set
OL,4,Afor approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FUpdated plans for 133 homes on farmland
OL,7,Fin North Yorkshire are expected to be
OL,8,Fapproved by councillors.
OL,10,FOutline planning permission was granted
OL,11,Fin 2024 for the development at Cow Dyke
OL,12,FFarm on Skipton Road in Harrogate, but
OL,13,Fthe application did not consider access
OL,14,Fwithin the site, a North Yorkshire
OL,15,FCouncil (NYC) report said.
OL,17,FA reserved matters application,
OL,18,Ffocusing on access, appearance,
OL,19,Flandscaping, layout and scale, has now
OL,20,Fbeen recommended for approval by
OL,21,Fcouncil officers.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
